@startuml Send_Announcement
title Activity Diagram - Send Announcement

|Instructor|
start
:Open Announcements page;
:Click "Create Announcement";
:Enter announcement details:\n- Title\n- Content\n- Target Audience\n  (All/Class/Specific);
if (Target Audience == "Class"?) then (yes)
  :Select class;
elseif (Target Audience == "Specific"?) then
  :Select students;
endif

:Click "Send";

|Web Application|
:Validate input data;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  :Display validation error;
  stop
endif

:Send announcement data\nto backend;

|Backend API|
:Extract admin/instructor ID\nfrom JWT token;
:Call AnnouncementService.\nCreateAnnouncementAsync(adminUserId, request);
:Create Announcement entity:\n- AdminId\n- Title\n- Content\n- TargetAudience\n- CreatedAt;
:Save to database;

if (TargetAudience == "Class"?) then (yes)
  :Get all students in class;
  :Send bulk notifications\nto all students;
elseif (TargetAudience == "All"?) then
  :Get all students;
  :Send bulk notifications;
else (Specific)
  :Send notifications\nto selected students;
endif

:Return AnnouncementResponseDto;
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Refresh announcements list;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View sent announcement;
stop
@enduml

